quran[25]{c,v,t}:
  82,1,"When the heavens split apart,"
  82,2,"when the stars (and planets) are scattered,"
  82,3,"when the oceans (and rivers) are made to overflow,"
  82,4,"and when the graves are overturned,"
  82,5,then (every) soul shall know what it has sent forth and left behind.
  82,6,"O humankind! What has deceived you concerning your Generous Lord,"
  82,7,"Who created you, fashioned you and perfected you in proportional balance,"
  82,8,"and in whatever form He pleased, composed you?"
  82,9,"No, indeed! Instead, you deny the (final) Retribution."
  82,10,"Indeed, there are vigilant watchers over you,"
  82,11,"(the) noble recorders, writing everything (down)."
  82,12,They know (all) that you do.
  82,13,"Indeed, the virtuous shall be in Bliss,"
  82,14,and the wicked shall be in Hell.
  82,15,"They will enter it to burn on the Day of Retribution,"
  82,16,and they will never be absent from it.
  82,17,What will make you realise what the Day of Retribution is?
  82,18,Again! What will make you realise what the Day of Retribution is?
  82,19,(It is) the Day when a soul shall not possess (any benefit) for another soul. And all authority on that Day will belong to Allah.
  83,1,Woe to those who give short measures!
  83,2,"Those, when they take the measure (of any commodity) from people, they take (it) in full."
  83,3,"But, when they measure or weigh for others, they give less."
  83,4,"Do such people not think that they will be resurrected,"
  83,5,"for a tremendous Day,"
  83,6,a Day when (all) people will stand before the Lord of all worlds?
